From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Neogram Patchset <patches@neogram.invalid>
Subject: debloat/dialog-media-preview: no media thumbnails in the chat list

Behind NeoOptions.DIALOG_MEDIA_PREVIEW (on by default). With it off, DialogCell.updateMessageThumbs leaves the thumbnails out (thumbsCount is reset for every layout), so the last message of a chat shows only its text.
---
 TMessagesProj/src/main/java/org/telegram/ui/Cells/DialogCell.java | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/TMessagesProj/src/main/java/org/telegram/ui/Cells/DialogCell.java b/TMessagesProj/src/main/java/org/telegram/ui/Cells/DialogCell.java
index 0000000..0000000 100644
--- a/TMessagesProj/src/main/java/org/telegram/ui/Cells/DialogCell.java
+++ b/TMessagesProj/src/main/java/org/telegram/ui/Cells/DialogCell.java
@@ -5734,7 +5734,7 @@ public class DialogCell extends BaseCell implements StoriesListPlaceProvider.Ava
     }
 
     public void updateMessageThumbs() {
-        if (message == null) {
+        if (message == null || ru.llacker.neogram.dialogs.NeoDialogs.hideMediaPreview()) {
             return;
         }
         String restrictionReason = MessagesController.getInstance(message.currentAccount).getRestrictionReason(message.messageOwner.restriction_reason);
